# The repository ignores *.png globally because screenshots tend to carry real
# printer names and job names. These five are synthetic renders produced from
# hand-written demo data, and they are allowlisted by exact name so a stray
# capture dropped in this directory stays ignored rather than committing
# silently.
!full.png
!full-two.png
!half-horizontal.png
!half-vertical.png
!quadrant.png
